{"message":"For a 3-month trip, the **Bluest Account** appears to be the best fit among the documented personal checking options: it charges **no Rho-Bank foreign ATM fee** and rebates foreign ATM operator fees up to **$50 per monthly statement cycle**. Third-party fees above that cap may remain your responsibility. It also earns 2.25% APY, though its monthly maintenance fee was not specified in the information available to me, so I can’t guarantee it is the lowest total-cost option without checking your eligibility and the applicable account terms.

For comparison, Purple rebates up to $30 per month but charges a $15 monthly fee unless you maintain a $3,750 minimum daily balance. Green Fee-Free has no Rho foreign ATM fee, but its $22.50 monthly fee is waived only with a $150 minimum daily balance and no foreign ATM rebate is documented.

I can check your eligibility and open the Bluest Account, but first I need to verify your identity. Please provide any **two** of these four fields: date of birth, email address, phone number, or mailing address."}
